  "docsUrl": "https://bestax.io/docs/api/elements/table",
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Default Table",
      "code": "<Table>\n  <Thead>\n    <Tr>\n      <Th>Name</Th>\n      <Th>Age</Th>\n      <Th>Role</Th>\n    </Tr>\n  </Thead>\n  <Tbody>\n    <Tr>\n      <Td>Alice</Td>\n      <Td>30</Td>\n      <Td>Engineer</Td>\n    </Tr>\n    <Tr>\n      <Td>Bob</Td>\n      <Td>28</Td>\n      <Td>Designer</Td>\n    </Tr>\n  </Tbody>\n</Table>"
    },
    {
      "title": "All Modifiers",
      "code": "<Table isBordered isStriped isNarrow isHoverable isFullwidth isResponsive>\n  <Thead>\n    <Tr>\n      <Th>Column 1</Th>\n      <Th>Column 2</Th>\n    </Tr>\n  </Thead>\n  <Tbody>\n    <Tr>\n      <Td>Cell 1</Td>\n      <Td>Cell 2</Td>\n    </Tr>\n    <Tr>\n      <Td>Cell 3</Td>\n      <Td>Cell 4</Td>\n    </Tr>\n  </Tbody>\n</Table>"
    },
    {
      "title": "Responsive Table (horizontal scroll on mobile)",
      "code": "<Table isResponsive>\n  <Thead>\n    <Tr>\n      {Array.from({ length: 20 }, (_, i) => (\n        <Th key={`col-${i + 1}`}>Column {i + 1}</Th>\n      ))}\n    </Tr>\n  </Thead>\n  <Tbody>\n    {Array.from({ length: 2 }, (_, row) => (\n      <Tr key={row}>\n        {Array.from({ length: 20 }, (_, col) => (\n          <Td key={`cell-${row + 1}-${col + 1}`}>\n            Cell {row + 1}-{col + 1}\n          </Td>\n        ))}\n      </Tr>\n    ))}\n  </Tbody>\n</Table>"
    },
    {
      "title": "Colored Cells",
      "code": "<Table isBordered isFullwidth>\n  <Thead>\n    <Tr>\n      <Th>Cell Color</Th>\n      <Th>Example</Th>\n    </Tr>\n  </Thead>\n  <Tbody>\n    <Tr>\n      <Td>Primary</Td>\n      <Td color=\"primary\">Primary Colored Cell</Td>\n    </Tr>\n    <Tr>\n      <Td>Success</Td>\n      <Td color=\"success\">Success Colored Cell</Td>\n    </Tr>\n    {/* ...and so on for link, warning, danger, info, black, dark, light, white */}\n  </Tbody>\n</Table>"
    },
    {
      "title": "Highlighted Row",
      "code": "<Table isFullwidth>\n  <Thead>\n    <Tr>\n      <Th>Team</Th>\n      <Th>Wins</Th>\n      <Th>Losses</Th>\n    </Tr>\n  </Thead>\n  <Tbody>\n    <Tr isSelected>\n      <Td>Ice Wolves</Td>\n      <Td>32</Td>\n      <Td>8</Td>\n    </Tr>\n    <Tr>\n      <Td>Frost Giants</Td>\n      <Td>30</Td>\n      <Td>9</Td>\n    </Tr>\n  </Tbody>\n</Table>"
    },
    {
      "title": "Custom Alignment and Width",
      "code": "<Table>\n  <Thead>\n    <Tr>\n      <Th isAligned=\"left\" width={200}>\n        Name\n      </Th>\n      <Th isAligned=\"right\">Score</Th>\n    </Tr>\n  </Thead>\n  <Tbody>\n    <Tr>\n      <Td>Jane Doe</Td>\n      <Td>98</Td>\n    </Tr>\n  </Tbody>\n</Table>"
    },
    {
      "title": "Compound (dot-notation) usage",
      "code": "<Table isStriped>\n  <Table.Thead>\n    <Table.Tr>\n      <Table.Th>Team</Table.Th>\n      <Table.Th>Points</Table.Th>\n    </Table.Tr>\n  </Table.Thead>\n  <Table.Tbody>\n    <Table.Tr>\n      <Table.Td>Maple Leafs</Table.Td>\n      <Table.Td>98</Table.Td>\n    </Table.Tr>\n  </Table.Tbody>\n</Table>"
    }
  ],
  "accessibility": "- **Semantics:** Uses `<table>`, `<thead>`, `<tbody>`, `<tfoot>`, `<tr>`, `<th>`, and `<td>`—all proper HTML table elements.\n- **Responsive:** When using `isResponsive`, the table is wrapped in a scrollable container.\n- **Screen Readers:** Always use `<Th>` for header cells, and provide descriptive column headings.\n\n:::tip\nFor responsive tables, ensure your column headers are clear and concise for small screens.\n:::",
  "related": ["Block", "useBulmaClasses"],
